Sunita took me near the café's large espresso machine.
I looked at the machine and felt a little scared.
There were many buttons and dials on the machine.
Sunita looked at me and smiled.
She said, "Maya, don't worry."
I wanted to learn to operate this machine.
Sunita showed me the first button.
She said, "This is the first step to making coffee."
Then she showed me the second button.
I listened to her words very carefully.
After that, Sunita pointed towards the steam wand.
She said, "Maya, this pipe gets very hot."
"You have to learn to use it safely."
I nodded and said, "Yes, I will be careful."
I have also learned to turn the machine's dial.
Sunita has explained everything to me very well.
Now I have understood a lot about the machine.
